WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.223 --> 00:00:02.662
- Back in the day,
before a lot of my videos

00:00:02.662 --> 00:00:04.434
were going viral
probably one of my first

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:06.282
viral business statements were

00:00:06.282 --> 00:00:07.513
"Get off the bitch train."

00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:11.953
JT called in Jason Calacanis'
show This Week In Tech

00:00:11.953 --> 00:00:13.433
and was trying to 
make a decision.

00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:16.294
I always talk about 
pondering and debating

00:00:16.294 --> 00:00:18.153
and I just finally got 
fed up and I said,

00:00:18.153 --> 00:00:19.645
"Dude, get off the bitch train."

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:20.953
And people liked it.

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:22.532
- [JT] Just moving forward.
- [Jason] Yeah, okay.

00:00:22.532 --> 00:00:26.143
You got two great ideas,
Gary, your advice is?

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.465
- [Gary] Flip a coin, JT.

00:00:28.465 --> 00:00:33.014
Are you equally 
100% all-in on both?

00:00:33.014 --> 00:00:36.163
Like Jason when he gets 
pocket aces, bullets,

00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:37.803
he's putting it all in.
- [Jason] Push!

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:41.184
- Are you equally feeling 
that on both products?

00:00:41.184 --> 00:00:43.364
- [JT] I am and I knew you
were going to ask me that.

00:00:43.364 --> 00:00:46.075
I am passionate 
about both concepts.

00:00:46.075 --> 00:00:46.914
- So dude, honestly,--

00:00:46.914 --> 00:00:48.260
- [JT] And that's why I'm
having such a hard time.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:48.953
- You know what?

00:00:48.953 --> 00:00:50.674
Honestly, you gotta 
get off the bitch train

00:00:50.674 --> 00:00:52.314
and just pick one.
You'll be fine.

00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:54.164
You like them both,
it sounds that way.

00:00:54.164 --> 00:00:56.303
- Ok, James.
- [Gary] Take care, man.

00:00:56.303 --> 00:00:59.023
- Call in in a couple of weeks 
and tell us that you started.

00:00:59.023 --> 00:01:00.283
If you're still on the 
bitch train, --

00:01:00.283 --> 00:01:01.003
- [JT] Okay.

00:01:01.003 --> 00:01:02.055
- [Jason] don't call back.
- [Gary] A couple weeks?

00:01:02.055 --> 00:01:03.626
Tweet out tonight
that you got it goin'.

00:01:03.626 --> 00:01:05.582
(light music)

